  "id": "kappa",
  "term": "kappa",
  "definition": "In this source, kappa refers to the kappa opioid receptor, a biological receptor that can be activated by a kappa opioid receptor agonist such as difelikefalin. The study describes these receptors in kidney tissue and links their activation with protective effects in experimental acute kidney injury.",
